# Prettier is configured with "endOfLine": "lf" (heyhomie-client/.prettierrc.json),
# and CI runs `npm run lint` on Linux. Without this, a Windows clone gets CRLF in
# the working tree and eslint reports thousands of `Delete ␍` errors.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never normalise
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webm binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
